      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "Resort_Umbrella_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey @, you think you could build a raft?#$e#I saw a few cool islands on the way here I want to visit.",
      "translation": "Hej, @, umíš postavit vor?#$e#Cestou sem jsem zahlédla několik skvělých ostrovů, které chci navštívit.",
